{"verse_key": "13:34", "surah": 13, "verse": 34, "text_uthmani": "لَّهُمْ عَذَابٌ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَلَعَذَابُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ أَشَقُّ ۖ وَمَا لَهُم مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ مِن وَاقٍ", "translation": "For them will be punishment in the life of [this] world, and the punishment of the Hereafter is more severe. And they will not have from Allāh any protector.", "verse_from_ms": 869260, "verse_to_ms": 883780, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "لَّهُمْ", "start_ms": 869260, "end_ms": 870140}, {"i": 1, "text": "عَذَابٌ", "start_ms": 870140, "end_ms": 871620}, {"i": 2, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 871620, "end_ms": 871900}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ", "start_ms": 871900, "end_ms": 872860}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "start_ms": 872860, "end_ms": 873830}, {"i": 5, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 873830, "end_ms": 875040}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَلَعَذَابُ", "start_ms": 875040, "end_ms": 876320}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ", "start_ms": 876320, "end_ms": 877140}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَشَقُّ", "start_ms": 877140, "end_ms": 877710}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 877710, "end_ms": 878480}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 878480, "end_ms": 879430}, {"i": 11, "text": "لَهُم", "start_ms": 879430, "end_ms": 880230}, {"i": 12, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 880230, "end_ms": 881060}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 881060, "end_ms": 883705}, {"i": 14, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَاقٍ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}